          ],
          "content": "Look at Table 2.6. Recreate a similar table on the blackboard."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.259,
            0.163,
            0.886,
            0.242
          ],
          "content": " List the names of plants and animals you or your classmates have observed in the regions given in the table or already know about. A few examples are given. You can add more."
